-- Complete private proving inside Zheng over Goldilocks and Hemera. Joy now
+Joy runs the Trident compiler as a nox program, preserves its complete output,
+and supports independently verified public certificates of that computation.
+These changes are staged on `release/0.4`; the branch name does not change the
+tested package version. Full self-build adversarial acceptance remains tracked
+in the [Trident self-hosting ledger](../trident/audit/self-hosting-progress.md).
+
+1. Execute complete ART1 programs and JOB1 compiler requests with `run-artifact`.
+   The bounded heap evaluator preserves structured RES1 results and extracted
+   programs, so the compiler can receive sources and return executable nox
+   without a host compiler supplying the result. See
+   [compiler jobs](specs/compiler-jobs.md) and
+   [structured execution](specs/structured-run.md).
+2. Add `prove-artifact` and `verify-artifact` for the public `JOYSC001`
+   certificate. Zheng checks dynamic continuations, complete output and exact
+   semantic charge against independently supplied program/input files, without
+   rerunning the compiler. The format discloses its witness and has linear size
+   and verification work. Its [contract](specs/structured-certificates.md)
+   separates proved logical quantities from observed host memory and time.
+3. Let explicitly selected compacting execution, proving and verification use
+   their own cooperative `--time-ms` deadline up to four hours. The default
+   remains 30 seconds. Work/storage allowances stay independently bounded, and
+   failed execution or verification preserves existing destinations. See the
+   [deadline policy](specs/structured-run.md#explicit-compacting-execution).
+4. Validate the coordinated package across six native platforms and all
+   producer/consumer pairs, with a separately measured macOS 14 ARM consumer.
+   The [accepted package audit](https://github.com/cyberia-to/trisha/blob/95899e8f4fe32b5d7269d92b5e63ef429fbfafac/audit/final-host-ceiling-package/README.md)
+   binds exact source/binary identities and compiler-kit results. Public release
+   promotion remains a separate step.
